# Density Compare
# Mendelevium (Md) — real density 10.3 g/cm³. equal masses: Mendelevium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Mendelevium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 9.2mm color: #00ff80 at (-20mm, 4.6mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 82.2 g — the water cube is the reference
